{"title":"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 25","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The total <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Area\" title=\"Area\">area</a> of all the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Faces\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Faces\">faces</a> of a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Rectangular_prism\" title=\"Rectangular prism\">rectangular solid</a> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/d/23df55eea0a03154d9553fb028814fb37a064c0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$22\\text{cm}^2$\" width=\"45\" height=\"15\" />, and the total length of all its <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Edges\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Edges\">edges</a> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/0/c6064e888610c9ae0fa100fce2c1ce0c19e16122.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24\\text{cm}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"39\" height=\"12\" />. Then the length in cm of any one of its <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Diagonal#Polyhedra\" title=\"Diagonal\">interior diagonals</a> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/8/5e882d956ced72d76a66251509a80e566e341a26.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ }\\sqrt{11} \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }\\sqrt{12} \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } \\sqrt{13}\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ }\\sqrt{14} \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } \\text{Not uniquely determined}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"611\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the edge lengths be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/3/3834f0cef2a1f4d8524aa5bc8e3faca298550862.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"25\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />. Therefore, the total area of all its faces is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/c/53c5a021481a2af4d625686d42c9821fcfec4bcf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2ab+2bc+2ac$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"122\" height=\"14\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/c/8ec771603b0be29411df69ca0d9736a0761a7c7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2ab+2bc+2ac=22$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"164\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/8/928ffe0adfcac25a557290625aed87f8759de4fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab+bc+ac=11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"136\" height=\"14\" />. Also, the total lengths of all of its edges is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/7/547350c53877936e3b9ff24bd3c33f30e374fd46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4a+4b+4c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"97\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/8/42824c16bfc77c6e897d1f045afd860c7f7fd243.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4a+4b+4c=24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"139\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/6/6965c2f7e493de2e2805f4acb42617afc4a2a782.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"102\" height=\"14\" />. Therefore, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/8/928ffe0adfcac25a557290625aed87f8759de4fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab+bc+ac=11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"136\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>and\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/6/6965c2f7e493de2e2805f4acb42617afc4a2a782.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"102\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>The length of the interior diagonal is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/e/66edd9d946b1cd58b2595414a1dbf13a1a657b62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{a^2+b^2+c^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"107\" height=\"18\" />, so if we can find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/c/1ac816c290967e49b43b79af7c7fbb65dc613f4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2+b^2+c^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"91\" height=\"16\" />, we can find the diagonal. We square the second equation above to introduce an <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/c/1ac816c290967e49b43b79af7c7fbb65dc613f4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2+b^2+c^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"91\" height=\"16\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/2/e1223cbf16979c4f4827426df8e56f3869de8b05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+b+c)^2=a^2+b^2+c^2+2ab+2bc+2ac=36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>However, we already know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/c/8ec771603b0be29411df69ca0d9736a0761a7c7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2ab+2bc+2ac=22$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"164\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/8/0a8ed3538b7c20a704b8a6de9241919d3f136ba4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2+b^2+c^2+22=36\\implies a^2+b^2+c^2=14\\implies \\sqrt{a^2+b^2+c^2}=\\sqrt{14}, \\boxed{\\text{D}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"605\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME\" title=\"1984 AHSME\">1984 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1984 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1984\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">Problem 26</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017174501\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.042 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.065 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 168/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2494/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 152/2